@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Melihat Data Rekap Presensi Siswa (Tata Usaha)

actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary View as V
control Controller as C
entity Model as M
boundary "File System" as FS

== Akses Halaman Rekap Presensi ==

TU -> V: 1. Akses Dashboard
V --> TU: Tampilkan Dashboard

TU -> V: 2. Pilih "Presensi Siswa" > "Rekap Kehadiran"
V -> C: Handle navigation
C -> M: Get today's attendance data
M --> C: Return attendance data & statistics
C -> V: Load rekap page with filters
V --> TU: Tampilkan halaman rekap + filter options

== Lihat dan Filter Data ==

group Filter Data
    TU -> V: 3. Pilih filter (tanggal/angkatan/kelas/semester)
    V -> C: Handle filter selection
    C -> M: Get filtered attendance data
    M --> C: Return filtered data & statistics
    C -> V: Update display
    V --> TU: Tampilkan data sesuai filter
end

== Fitur Tambahan ==

group Export Data
    TU -> V: 4. Klik "Export CSV"
    V -> C: Handle export request
    C -> M: Get current data
    M --> C: Return data for export
    C -> FS: Generate CSV file
    FS --> C: CSV file created
    C -> V: Trigger download
    V --> TU: Download file CSV
end

group Navigation
    alt navigate to QR scan
        TU -> V: 5. Klik "Scan QR Presensi"
        V -> C: Handle navigation
        C -> V: Redirect to QR page
        V --> TU: Diarahkan ke halaman QR Presensi
    end
end

group Reset Filter
    alt reset filters
        TU -> V: 6. Reset filter
        V -> C: Handle reset
        C -> M: Get default data
        M --> C: Return unfiltered data
        C -> V: Reset display
        V --> TU: Tampilkan data default
    end
end

note over TU, M
**Pre-kondisi:**
- Tata Usaha login di dashboard
- Data presensi tersedia dalam sistem

**Post-kondisi:**
- Menampilkan rekap kehadiran siswa
- Data dapat difilter (tanggal, angkatan, kelas, semester)
- Data dapat diekspor ke CSV
- Statistik kehadiran ditampilkan sesuai filter

**Filter yang tersedia:**
- Tanggal, Angkatan, Kelas, Semester
- Kombinasi multiple filter
- Reset ke tampilan default
end note

@enduml